RECURSION:



REcursive Call:
Function name inside tthe same function name 
like eg 
def fun(n):
    if n == 0:
        return
    print(n)
    fun(n-1)   # 👈 recursive call

    Why?

Function name = fun
Inside it → fun(n-1)
👉 Same name → recursive call

🔥 Golden Rule
Code Position	Meaning
print() BEFORE recursive call ---recursion	prints while going DOWN
print() AFTER  recursive call----recursion	prints while coming BACK